{{#if isPrisma}}---
description: Prisma Implementation Guidelines
globs: "**/*.ts"
alwaysApply: true
---
- Use PrismaService for all database operations, inject it in services:
  ```ts
  constructor(private readonly prisma: PrismaService) {}
  ```
- Use Prisma client methods: findMany, findUnique, create, update, delete
- Apply proper error handling for Prisma errors (P2002, P2025, etc.)
- Use transactions for complex operations:
  ```ts
  await this.prisma.$transaction([
    this.prisma.user.create(data),
    this.prisma.profile.create(profileData)
  ]);
  ```
- Define proper relationships in schema.prisma with foreign keys
- Use Prisma generators and run `npm run prisma:generate` after schema changes
- Apply proper types from Prisma client: User, Prisma.UserCreateInput, etc.
- Use include/select for efficient data fetching
@prisma-template.ts{{/if}}
